    "created_at": "2016-11-20T22:50:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-20T22:50:02Z",
    "body": "> In the interest of getting further data, I’ve added a use counter for it to the W3C HTML checker.\n\nNumbers at the moment from all five W3C validator instances are:\n\n```\nDoctype with「SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\"」found                  98/188942     0.000523\nDoctype with「SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\"」found                  83/192644     0.000433\nDoctype with「SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\"」found                  71/188054     0.000379\nDoctype with「SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\"」found                  61/188327     0.000325\nDoctype with「SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\"」found                  65/185140     0.000351\nTotal:\nDoctype with「SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\"」found                 378/943107     0.000400 \n```\n\nThose are for the usage pattern over the weekend, so will change some during the weekend.\n\nBut anyway, that’s roughly 400 out of one million, or ~0.04%.\n",
